{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"95b949933970c58837bbd7a7a46ff57e1f763f663c8fce9544bc447af9f10b44","ja":"それでは、本番前にもう1度……。","zh":"那么，正式开始前再来1遍……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a1bebdcd3cd3e953168f1888e0ac4ce63d1d8819d3c11ad64a956736206a4176","ja":"チヅル～！\nスタッフさんが、本番いけるヨ～って。","zh":"千鹤——！\n工作人员说，可以正式上场了哟～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"213a47319c94b6e67b785da891c72ef03b9dcefe5494b46a9191764ecf3754aa","ja":"……！　覚悟を決めなければいけませんね。","zh":"……！必须下定决心了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"02a0cbadb067d2f5d871d1d487ffc017d04e0089abead22f99b8be2e8d443d66","ja":"ではみなさま……\n楽しみましょう、心のままに！","zh":"那么各位……\n尽情享受吧，随心而乐！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"514694ae9a23411071900015a20699760a88f449407b8eb7d7bb5651e3a56a56","ja":"そして歌とダンスと手拍子による\n路上PV撮影が終わり……。","zh":"随后，歌曲、舞蹈和拍手相伴的街头PV拍摄结束了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"779677d7fe478f00f3f0be4c26c14d1df2adffdf559a76e6cc86c893d2ec3df5","ja":"出来た……。","zh":"完成了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"90e3185e4cb7fcb33106dc6c4c46c932ee33d180b8e612a5f9b21ddfa649b8c6","ja":"ワオ！　みんなーありがとー！\nとーってもステキだったヨ～♪","zh":"哇！大家——谢谢你们——！\n真是太棒了哟～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"efabef3f55d7e2090ae83bc683b61d59e74b6164724f2b3f58d2f34742644554","ja":"手拍子が響き渡って……たくさんの方と\n歌う素晴らしさ、改めて感じましたわ！","zh":"掌声回荡开来……让我再次感受到了与许多人一同歌唱的美好！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d7887a56a09c5cb0dda9f6547db6d4414bf1448fb3222b02f11745a9f049c395","ja":"ウンウン！　みんなのおかげで、\nパワーがイッパイあふれてきたネ！","zh":"嗯嗯！多亏了大家，力量满满地涌出来了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8c395e29823ceb640640b48e213c8b7437319758b242faa81f9c8043d36fc534","ja":"リードするつもりだったのに……\n背中を押していただきましたわね！","zh":"明明是打算带头的……  \n却被您推了一把呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e8b1aba7b8a48f12b7105f67c81af252a8062a810582d395a83ba99fd0721ecb","ja":"うん、ほんとに！　みんなすごいよ……！\nボク、なんだか泣きそうになっちゃったもん！","zh":"嗯，真的！大家都好厉害啊……！\n我都不知不觉快要哭出来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"a7e4318d9e4d2d8d8e1b7324486c8ac4d9ddaa0fd800fb769775597251fc1cb4","ja":"みんなとの撮影、本当に楽しかったよ！\nもう終わり～って、少し寂しいけど……。","zh":"和大家一起拍摄，真的很开心！\n虽然结束了～，但还是有点寂寞……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"6e681921aa6f8b8f02510538d9fa8640862bee82999f4a0d2813357a6c35d5f0","ja":"また一緒に歌えるチャンスはあるよね！\nその時のこと今から楽しみにしてるから！","zh":"我们还会有机会一起唱歌的吧！\n我现在就开始期待那一天了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7cee61066947fbf25064b4097534c2cd45f321361cc5f7c5d42086de32073079","ja":"あたたかいこの気持ち……PVを見るたび\n歌うたびに、きっと思い出します！","zh":"每次观看PV、每次唱起歌，我一定都会想起这份温暖的心情……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_977.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"937ba7857835344a168c9f8984f94cce1f85262b634f68dca037025ac501d41a","ja":"素敵な時間を一緒に過ごしていただいて、\n本当にありがとうございました！","zh":"感谢您与我们共度这段美好时光，真的非常感谢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
